WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.884
A healthcare compliance programme needs to work in everyday decisions.

00:04.884 --> 00:09.208
At Eunomia Pharma Services, we help pharmaceutical and biotech

00:09.208 --> 00:17.775
companies design and implement practical programmes, with clear
ownership, effective controls and guidance people can use.

00:17.775 --> 00:22.579
We translate complex requirements into policies, standard operating

00:22.579 --> 00:27.864
procedures and approval processes shaped around
your business and its risks.

00:27.864 --> 00:32.107
Our support includes risk assessments, compliance training,

00:32.107 --> 00:39.394
third-party due diligence, conflicts of interest, grants and funding,
and whistleblowing arrangements.

00:39.394 --> 00:43.958
We also help identify gaps, prepare for audits and inspections, and

00:43.958 --> 00:49.563
implement corrective actions with accountable owners and
effectiveness checks.

00:49.563 --> 00:54.367
By connecting governance, training, monitoring and evidence, we help

00:54.367 --> 00:59.491
make compliance consistent, repeatable and embedded
in daily operations.

00:59.491 --> 01:06.858
Whether you’re building a programme from scratch or strengthening an
existing framework, Eunomia can help.

01:06.858 --> 01:10.060
A practical programme, built to work day to day.
